      "scope": "Unit",
      "engineArgumentCount": 0,
      "valence": "Positive",
      "description": "When a unit where all models have this rule is activated, roll as many dice as the max. number of models/wounds it could restore. For each 5\u002B you may restore one model/wound. Note that new models may only be restored if they can be placed in coherency with non-restored models."
    },
